# Design Tokens

## Color Palette
Never hardcode hex values. Use Tailwind token classes or CSS variables:

| Token | Value | Tailwind Class |
|---|---|---|
| Primary (forest) | `#1A302B` | `text-primary`, `bg-primary` |
| Primary strong | `#0B2D1E` | `bg-primary-strong` |
| Accent (gold) | `#C5A373` | `bg-accent`, `text-accent` |
| Cream | `#F9F8F3` | `bg-cream`, `bg-background` |
| Dark | `#1A1A1A` | `text-dark` |
| Muted | `#6B6B6B` | `text-muted` |

## Typography
- `font-display` — Fraunces
- `font-sans` — Nunito Sans
